   "text": "## RealX app build graph\n107 nodes and 2 follow-up items in 11 milestones, 797 dependencies, 3 parallel build streams, one milestone at a time. Opus 5.5 (high) plans, Grok 4.7 (xhigh) builds, Opus 5.5 (high) does the node QA at every loop; Fable 5.1 (high) runs the graph QA at each milestone close.\n**Red card:** oracle node (the node QA writes hidden tests first). **Red edge:** critical path (424-616 agent-hours).\n**Lane colours:** cyan platform and plan · green compliance, register, money and services · purple chain and wallets · yellow design and screens · orange quality · grey P2 and P3. Text cards are scheduled follow-up items that run under their owner's note.\nGenerated by `06 Evidence/Tools/app_plan/build_app_plan.py`; see [[App Development Graph]]."
  }
